---@field id string A UUID string identifying this canvas.
---@field key string Exact key to read.
---@field limit? number Maximum JSON characters in this response.
---@field offset? number Character offset from next_offset.
---@field revision? string Revision from the first chunk. Required when offset is greater than zero.
---@field scope posthog.canvases.GetCanvasesStateValueRequestScope|string Scope of the value to read. * `user` - user * `shared` - shared

---@alias posthog.canvases.GetCanvasesStateValueRequestScope "user"|"shared"

