---Everything needed to open the canvas, in one round trip.
---
---Returns the record, the live build (with its signed artifact URL), and —
---only when there is nothing built to render — the head source project
---(freeform/component) or the layout document (grid). Send the response's
---ETag back as If-None-Match to revalidate without a body.
---
---`GET /api/projects/{project_id}/canvases/{id}/view/`
---@param input posthog.canvases.GetCanvasesViewRequest
---@return posthog.canvases.CanvasViewResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:get_canvases_view(input) end

---Invoke one registered action verb as the viewer.
---
---The canvas must declare the verb in capabilities.posthog.actions (the
---reviewed permission boundary); the write itself runs with the viewer's
---own permissions, exactly as if they acted in the app.
---
---`POST /api/projects/{project_id}/canvases/{id}/actions/invoke/`
---Errors: BadRequest, Forbidden.
---@param input posthog.canvases.InvokeCanvasesActionRequest
---@return posthog.canvases.CanvasActionResult? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:invoke_canvases_action(input) end

---Run one PostHog MCP tool as the viewer.
---
---The canvas must declare the tool in capabilities.posthog.tools. The
---tool runs on the MCP server with a token minted for the viewer, so it
---has the viewer's own permissions, exactly as if they called it from
---an MCP client.
---
---`POST /api/projects/{project_id}/canvases/{id}/tools/invoke/`
---Errors: BadRequest, Forbidden.
---@param input posthog.canvases.InvokeCanvasesToolRequest
---@return posthog.canvases.CanvasToolResult? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:invoke_canvases_tool(input) end

---Canvases: agent-built sandboxed browser apps, filed into channels.
---
---Source is versioned per publish and built server-side; the canvas app
---renders the published build's artifact from the isolated artifact origin.
---
---`GET /api/projects/{project_id}/canvases/`
---@param input posthog.canvases.ListCanvasesRequest
---@return posthog.canvases.PaginatedCanvasList? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:list_canvases(input) end

---The comment threads on this canvas, newest first. Open threads only unless include_resolved is set.
---
---`GET /api/projects/{project_id}/canvases/{id}/comments/`
---@param input posthog.canvases.ListCanvasesCommentsRequest
---@return posthog.canvases.CanvasCommentsResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:list_canvases_comments(input) end

---Write one key of the canvas's runtime state, or delete it with a null value.
---
---`POST /api/projects/{project_id}/canvases/{id}/state/set/`
---Errors: BadRequest, Forbidden.
---@param input posthog.canvases.SetCanvasesStateRequest
---@return posthog.canvases.CanvasStateEntry? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:set_canvases_state(input) end

---Update canvas metadata, including the space it belongs to.
---
---`PATCH /api/projects/{project_id}/canvases/{id}/`
---Errors: Forbidden.
---@param input posthog.canvases.UpdateCanvasesPartialRequest
---@return posthog.canvases.Canvas? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:update_canvases_partial(input) end

return Module
